title: Start
---
The Trader stands at the crossroads between the Five Lands. The road down is open. The Trial gate hums ahead.
[[Ask the Trader about the road|TraderRoad]]
[[Enter the Trial gate|TrialGate]]
[[Walk the road in silence|Descent]]
===
title: TraderRoad
---
<<set $souls = 1>>
The Trader smiles. "Every road has a price, traveler. But the first lesson is free: the road is the trial, walked down, not crossed."
Souls gathered: {$souls}.
[[Enter the Trial gate|TrialGate]]
[[Walk the road in silence|Descent]]
===
title: TrialGate
---
<<set $souls = 3>>
<<set $trial_done = true>>
The gate opens. Nine lights flicker — one burns brighter.
<<if $souls == 3>>
The Trial seals behind you. Souls gathered: {$souls}.
<<endif>>
[[Descend|Descent]]
===
title: Descent
---
The descent has five rooms: the Threshold, the Gallery of Masks, the Drowning Room, the Furnace, and the Still Point. At the Still Point waits your shadow self — yourself, unmasked.
<<if $trial_done == true>>
You descend with the gate sealed behind you. The dark keeps what it catches, and it is waiting.
<<else>>
You descend unsealed. The dark keeps what it catches, and it is waiting.
<<endif>>
[[Begin the descent|End]]
===
title: End
---
Named. Faced. Put down. Purification is not becoming someone else. It is meeting yourself and staying.
<<stop>>
===
